    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABKChpQA",
      "title": "ops: bump monorepo to develop and switch to op-service/log",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 1382,
      "body": "Bumps `ops` to monorepo develop at ethereum-optimism/optimism@fbfb3587c9 (ethereum-optimism/optimism#23527) and op-geth to `v1.101702.4-rc.1`, the version that commit pins.\n\n- ethereum-optimism/optimism#23527 moved op-fetcher's library: the `fetch/script` types are now in `op-fetcher/chaininfo` (`ChainConfig` → `Config`, `CreateChainConfig(out)` → `out.Config()`), with the same JSON shape. op-fetcher now reads chain info with `eth_call`s instead of a forge script. A full `codegen` run against public L1 RPCs gives the same output on this branch as on `main`.\n- `fetch.NewFetcher` now takes `op-service/log`'s `Logger`, so `ops` logs through `op-service/log` instead of `go-ethereum/log`.\n- The `validation` requirement in `ops/go.mod` moves up to the version the monorepo requires. `ops/go.work` still resolves it to the local module.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:04:41Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-10-23T09:32:05Z",
      "additions": 104,
      "deletions": 141
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABKCh7yA",
      "title": "ops: read superchain.toml from disk for the standard state",
      "author": "sebastianst",
      "number": 1383,
      "body": "`ops` took the standard op-deployer state's SuperchainConfig address from op-geth's `superchain` package, which embeds a copy of this registry's own configs. It now reads `superchain/configs/{mainnet,sepolia}/superchain.toml` from the repo. To find it, the state mergers, `OpDeployer` and the staging report now take the repo root.\n\nThis uses the registry's current data instead of a stale copy. The pinned op-geth embeds a snapshot of this repo from June. A change to a network's `superchain_config_addr` used to take effect only after a new op-geth snapshot and an op-geth bump. Now it applies in the same PR, and a network that isn't in the snapshot works too. Today the values are the same for both networks, and `TestMergeState`'s golden output covers sepolia.\n\nThis was the only op-geth-only package `ops` imported.\n\nConflicts with #1382 in the `deployer_test.go` imports only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:05:01Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-10-23T12:15:45Z",
      "additions": 57,
      "deletions": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABKUi6aA",
      "title": "Add kona-client v1.9.0 prestates",
      "author": "pauldowman",
      "number": 1389,
      "body": "Adds the `cannon64-kona` and `cannon64-kona-interop` prestates for kona-client v1.9.0.\n\n- `kona-client/v1.9.0` was finalized at the same commit as v1.9.0-rc.1 (`1286a886f0`), so the hashes are the reproducible rc.1 prestates added in #1378, which match CI's build of that commit.\n- Both hashes are published in the prestate bucket.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-23T18:38:16Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-10-23T21:20:56Z",
      "additions": 8,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs8AAAABKR43mQ",
      "title": "chore: automated codegen update 2026-10-23",
      "author": "opgitgovernance",
      "number": 1388,
      "body": "This is an automated PR created by the daily-codegen circleci job.\n\nPlease review and merge if the changes look correct.\n\nNote that only these files should have been modified:\n\n- [addresses.json](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/superchain/extra/addresses/addresses.json)\n- [chainList.json](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/chainList.json)\n- [chainList.toml](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/chainList.toml)\n\nFor more details see the [runbook](https://www.notion.so/oplabs/superchain-registry-daily-codegen-294f153ee162803788cdee48ec542ca4?v=d784200583d9415587c4dcd2b0c64b2f).",
